00:02:36.050 --> 00:02:39.010
Newspaper Club

00:02:38.210 --> 00:02:39.010
Eh?

00:02:39.240 --> 00:02:43.180
Didn't you hear me, Correspondent Asaba?
These are club presidential orders.

00:02:43.800 --> 00:02:45.970
Go on a date with Correspondent Iriya.

00:02:46.270 --> 00:02:47.480
Umm... I...

00:02:47.480 --> 00:02:50.350
Why not start out by 
catching a movie together?

00:02:50.350 --> 00:02:52.940
Then stop off at a café, hit up 
a karaoke box, go to a hotel...

00:02:52.940 --> 00:02:57.230
Go as far as you can! How does that sound? 
If you need a vehicle, I can lend you my light truck.

00:02:57.230 --> 00:02:59.950
If you'd prefer to ride tandem, 
I have a Super Cub, too.

00:02:59.950 --> 00:03:01.740
Why are we discussing this?

00:03:01.740 --> 00:03:06.440
Isn't it obvious? To get Correspondent Iriya 
into our Newspaper Club ASAP,

00:03:06.440 --> 00:03:08.330
and to gain her trust.

00:03:08.330 --> 00:03:10.870
That would make her feel like 
being here every day to help us out.

00:03:10.870 --> 00:03:15.670
Before too long, she'd feel like showing us
 around the Sonohara Base, right?

00:03:15.670 --> 00:03:18.330
T-That's impossible for me...

00:03:18.330 --> 00:03:21.090
Is that so? Then I guess I'll do it.

00:03:25.470 --> 00:03:28.140
Okay, I get it! I'll do it!

00:03:28.140 --> 00:03:29.920
All righty then!

